<title>USA: Pikes Peak Library, Colo., yields 5.55 pct in 2006.</title>
<headline>Pikes Peak Library, Colo., yields 5.55 pct in 2006.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc said it priced $2.500 million of Pikes Place Library District, Colo., certificates of participation lease revenues, Series 1996, with a top yield of 5.55 percent in 2006.</p>
